    "updated_at": "2026-06-26T12:48:38Z",
    "body": "Thank you for the suggestion, I'll investigate the history of this topic.\n\nThe reason I filed this issue was to discuss whether we could/should take a chance to make this particular Web IDL spec corner nicer, given that Chromium has never been fully spec compliant in this regard and nobody complained so far.\nSafari and Firefox do follow the spec here.",
